        "original_id": "10f5be65-18cc-5cc0-b453-51e3b55c9232",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Naser Mestarihi, Justin Sane\n- Roles: singer-songwriters, guitarists, multi-instrumentalists\n- Organizations: Anti-Flag\n- Places: Doha, Dubai, Qatar, United Arab Emirates, United States, Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania\n- Topics: punk rock\n\nFacts:\n- Anti-Flag is a United States-based punk rock band that was formed in 1988 in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania and is known for outspoken left-wing views.\n- Naser Mestarihi was born on 14 October 1987.\n- Naser Mestarihi is a Qatari-born Jordanian-Pakistani singer-songwriter and multi-instrumentalist who plays guitars, bass, and vocals.\n- Naser Mestarihi is based in Doha, Qatar and Dubai, United Arab Emirates.\n- Justin Cathal Geever is professionally known as Justin Sane.\n- Justin Sane is the lead guitarist and singer-songwriter of Anti-Flag.",
